    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c225f0b98ec1500c7956c9d0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我一次又一次，一次又一次，回想起今天\n见到的景象……她展现出的奔跑，那份\n强大。实在太过震撼――",
      "source_fingerprint": "02bb97bed6113989f09cc5d413a172931d73bc82ef0df30b153e6f7272888e1a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
