    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c6f8ed7ec19613dcba3e8f1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是空中救世主，空中救世主！！\n『樱花赏』参赛选手漂亮地率先冲线！赢得\n『NHK英里赛』的是空中救世主！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bca1349eefc823e46afe4fd95b554c9b6a781f391b9d1f0cf0a8bbc9c7a3465d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7346bd779fb32d2ee7affcaa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我对『樱花赏』后才刚调整过的，\n莱茵力量数据进一步修改。\n上调。――再次上调。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49df0a4b41416a1f13f279ccda118c249906c9561a9f37f087284f583eab55b3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
